   "detail": "43 rows (40 on the p2 Form A grid + 3 on the p3 filer continuation sheet) sum to EXACTLY 29,152.93. That equals the p3 attachment's printed 'TOTAL CONTRIBUTIONS: $29,152.93' AND the cover line-1 'Totals from This report' cell. It does NOT equal the CUMULATIVE cell 29,728.39; the difference is exactly the 575.46 in the LAST REPORT column, annotated on the cover as '(rollover from 2016 campaign)' and never itemised on any schedule. So the LEDGER IS PER-PERIOD on this filing, a DIFFERENT SCOPE from the cumulative figure this module publishes - reconciles_* being left blank for it is correct, not a failure. Form A's own printed TOTAL cell says only 'SEE ATTACHED SHEET' (a string, not a figure), so the attachment total is the schedule anchor. The cover's line-2 sub-$50 aggregate cells are BLANK in every column, so no small-donor aggregate competes here."
