 "gates": {
  "page_subtotal": "p2 Form A prints no figure of its own (its TOTAL cell reads 'SEE ATTACHED SHEET'), so p2+p3 are gated as one side: 43 rows = 29,152.93 = the p3 attachment's printed TOTAL CONTRIBUTIONS $29,152.93 (exact, to the cent). p4: 34 rows = 27,236.46 = the printed TOTAL EXPENDITURES 27236.46 (exact, to the cent). Both gates fired and both closed.",
  "row_count": "rowbands.py on p2 returned geometry_status 'row-count-mismatch' (17 h_rules, 3 data bands vs 40 expected) - the 0.7-degree skew and broken rules defeat it, so its output was NOT used as an oracle. Independent check instead: ink-projection over the amount column at 200 dpi returns 40 data bands on p2 (bands 5-53 minus the thin group rules) and 40 on p4 (34 inked + 6 grid rows printing only a '$'), matching the 40 and 34 rows emitted. p3's 3-row attachment table was counted by eye and confirmed in the 500 dpi crop.",
  "geometry_proof": "p2: first-row box pct:71.50,13.99 renders '$ 110.00' (line 1 Gary Turner), last-grid-row box pct:71.50,81.49 renders '$ 4202.59' (line 40 Jill Almquist), control one pitch below renders EMPTY. p3: first-row box renders '500.00' (line 41 Clark Kelsey), third-row box renders '50.00' (line 43 Brent Hall), control one pitch below renders empty of any data row (it clips only the top of the printed 'TOTAL CONTRIBUTIONS:' caption). p4: first-row box renders '$ 300.00' (line 1), row-34 box renders '$ 100.00' (line 34 Washington County Rep. Party), control one pitch below renders a bare '$' - a blank grid row, no data. All three pages' row indices confirmed additionally at a mid-page control (p2 line 27 Dean & Larene Cox lands where the model puts it).",
  "balance_chain": "Closes exactly: cover line1 CUMULATIVE 29,728.39 minus line3 CUMULATIVE 27,236.46 = 2,491.93 = the printed line-4 balance 2,491.93. (The beginning balance is not a separate printed cell on this form; the 575.46 'rollover from 2016 campaign' sits in line 1's LAST REPORT column and is inside the 29,728.39.) No earlier filing by this filer in this cycle is in this chunk, so no cross-filing cumulative chain was available to run."
 },
